description: multilayer-causal SEC4 Phase-1 CORE wave - §4 causal-strengthening on Gemma SM. Steers three deconfounded axes (readout - behavioural - confound) at L16-21 across alpha -3..+3 plus 5 random nulls, a no-steer baseline and 3 cumulative-window behavioural arms, replaying the exact addiction prompts (addiction_role_gm) on the held-out slice with alpha-independent seeds and manip-check logging. Tests H1 (behavioural axis writes betting) and H2 (readout axis inert although the better decoder). ISOLATED via arms_sec4_p0.yaml (MLC_ARMS_YAML), experiments/sec4_causal (MLC_HF_BASE), results/sec4_p0 (MLC_OUT), W&B project llm-addiction-sec4. Axis assets built offline by indicator_axes.py into assets/sec4.

target:
  service: sing
  name: msrresrchbasicvc
  workspace_name: msra-sh-aml-ws

environment:
  registry: mcr.microsoft.com
  image: aifx/acpt/stable-ubuntu2204-cu126-py310-torch28x:latest

code:
  local_dir: $CONFIG_DIR/

jobs:
  - name: mlc_sec4_p0
    sku: 80G4-H100
    sla_tier: Standard
    priority: high
    identity: managed
    submit_args:
      max_run_duration_seconds: 86400
      env:
        _AZUREML_SINGULARITY_JOB_UAI: "/subscriptions/c4c534bc-9978-4974-9c87-551f7c5754ef/resourceGroups/msra-sh-aml-rg/providers/Microsoft.ManagedIdentity/userAssignedIdentities/msra-sh-aml-uai"
        HF_TOKEN: HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER
        HUGGING_FACE_HUB_TOKEN: HF_TOKEN_PLACEHOLDER
        # sec4 isolation overrides (additive — unset elsewhere, so sm/ic/w-series
        # and prior xtask paths stay byte-identical):
        MLC_ARMS_YAML: multilayer_causal/configs/arms_sec4_p0.yaml
        MLC_HF_BASE: experiments/sec4_causal/checkpoints
        MLC_OUT: multilayer_causal/results/sec4_p0
        WANDB_PROJECT: llm-addiction-sec4
        WANDB_API_KEY: WANDB_API_KEY_PLACEHOLDER
    command:
      - nvidia-smi
      - |
        bash -c '
        set -x
        source /opt/conda/etc/profile.d/conda.sh
        conda activate ptca
        pip install -q "huggingface_hub<1.0" "transformers>=4.44" accelerate scipy pyyaml scikit-learn 2>&1 | tail -1
        python -c "import huggingface_hub, sklearn, scipy, yaml" || { echo PIP_INSTALL_FAILED; exit 1; }
        mkdir -p /scratch/mlc
        cd /scratch/mlc
        export HF_HOME=/scratch/mlc/hf_cache
        python -c "
        from huggingface_hub import hf_hub_download
        import os, tarfile
        p = hf_hub_download(\"llm-addiction-research/llm-addiction\", \"experiments/multilayer_causal/code/multilayer_causal.tar.gz\", repo_type=\"dataset\", token=os.environ[\"HF_TOKEN\"])
        tarfile.open(p).extractall(\".\")
        print(\"code extracted\")
        "
        export LLM_ADDICTION_BEHAVIORAL_ROOT=/scratch/mlc/data/behavioral
        # --- build the axis library ON the node (sae_lens + gemma-scope decoder +
        # cached SAE feats); abort the whole job if the build fails, so a bad axis
        # never wastes the rollout. Prints AUC/cos for early-log verification and
        # uploads the npz to HF for reproducibility. ---
        PYTHONPATH=/scratch/mlc python -m multilayer_causal.src.indicator_axes --model gemma --task slot_machine --indicators i_ba --axes readout,behavioural,confound --layers 16 21 --dest multilayer_causal/assets/sec4 || { echo SEC4_BUILD_FAILED; exit 1; }
        python -c "
        import numpy as np, glob, os
        from huggingface_hub import HfApi
        api = HfApi(); tok = os.environ[\"HF_TOKEN\"]
        fs = sorted(glob.glob(\"multilayer_causal/assets/sec4/*.npz\"))
        assert fs, \"no axis npz built\"
        for f in fs:
            d = np.load(f)
            print(\"SEC4_AXIS\", os.path.basename(f), \"auc=%.3f cos_read_write=%.3f\" % (float(d[\"auc\"]), float(d[\"cos_read_write\"])))
            api.upload_file(path_or_fileobj=f, path_in_repo=\"experiments/sec4_causal/assets/\"+os.path.basename(f), repo_id=\"llm-addiction-research/llm-addiction\", repo_type=\"dataset\", token=tok)
        print(\"SEC4_AXES_UPLOADED\", len(fs))
        " || { echo SEC4_AXIS_VERIFY_FAILED; exit 1; }
        bash multilayer_causal/run_arms.sh 4 sec4_readout_am3 sec4_readout_am2 sec4_readout_am1 sec4_readout_a0 sec4_readout_ap1 sec4_readout_ap2 sec4_readout_ap3 sec4_behavioural_am3 sec4_behavioural_am2 sec4_behavioural_am1 sec4_behavioural_a0 sec4_behavioural_ap1 sec4_behavioural_ap2 sec4_behavioural_ap3 sec4_confound_am3 sec4_confound_am2 sec4_confound_am1 sec4_confound_a0 sec4_confound_ap1 sec4_confound_ap2 sec4_confound_ap3 sec4_null_1 sec4_null_2 sec4_null_3 sec4_null_4 sec4_null_5 sec4_baseline sec4_cum_18_19 sec4_cum_16_21 sec4_cum_14_23
        echo SEC4_P0_DONE
        '
